OL,3,ARussia hits Ukrainian security
OL,4,Aheadquarters in drone attack, Zelensky
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Russian drone has hit the
OL,8,Fheadquarters of the Security Service of
OL,9,FUkraine (SBU) during a strike in the
OL,10,Fheart of Kyiv, Ukrainian President
OL,11,FVolodymyr Zelensky has said.
OL,13,FThe unmanned aerial vehicle crashed
OL,14,Finto the SBU headquarters on Friday
OL,15,Fafternoon, targeting a room used by
OL,16,Fsecurity chief Oleksandr Poklad.
OL,18,FIt is not clear whether Poklad was in
OL,19,Fthe building, but Zelensky said he had
OL,20,Fsince spoken to him to order an
OL,21,F"appropriate, tangible response".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
